{"the-chloe":{"title":"The Chloe","handle":"the-chloe","collection":"kid","collection_title":"The Royal Kid Herbal Collection","type":"soap","first_glance":"Brighten up bath time! The Chloe delivers a cheerful, sunny blend of Sweet Orange and delicate Cherry Blossom. Formulated to make washing up fun, this fruit-scented bar uses ultra-gentle botanical oils to cleanse active skin, leaving your little one feeling bright, refreshed, and soft from head to toe.","price":"12.99","quantity":"30","science":"The Chloe is a burst of pure sunshine designed to turn fussy morning bath times into a sweet, fruit-filled celebration. It pairs the joyful aroma of sweet orange with the delicate, soft scent of cherry blossom. This bar uses an ultra-mild, plant-milk base to gently lift away overnight sweat and dirt while leaving a soft, touchable finish.","benefits":["Sweet Orange Essential Oil (Citrus Sinensis): Offers a naturally uplifting, mood-boosting aromatherapeutic quality that reduces morning grumpiness. Its mild vitamin C content safely clarifies young skin without causing irritation","Cherry Blossom Extract (Prunus Serrulata): Rich in essential fatty acids and antioxidants, it repairs the skin's natural barrier and works as an anti-inflammatory agent to keep delicate skin smooth and supple"],"ideal_for":"Normal, active skin and morning baths.","profile":"","ingredients":"Coconut Milk, Mango Base, Shea Butter Base, Cocoa Base, Organic Lavender Oil, Organic Roman Chamomile Oil, Spearmint Oil, Sweet Orange Oil, Organic Cherry Blossom Oil, Mango FO, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.","ritual":"Work into a bubbly lather, smooth over damp skin, and rinse clean.","safety":"For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of infants without supervision.","aromatherapy":"This pro